---
const circleText = 'VER TRABAJOS • VER TRABAJOS • ';
---

<section class="relative pt-32 md:pt-44 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="wrap text-center">
    <p class="eyebrow fade-in justify-center" style="--d: 0.1s">Desarrollo web · Tortuguitas, Zona Norte</p>

    <h1 class="mt-8 text-[2.1rem] leading-[1.12] sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-[4.25rem] lg:leading-[1.08] max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <span class="line-mask"><span style="--d: 0.15s">Páginas web <span class="accent">a medida</span></span></span>
      <span class="line-mask"><span style="--d: 0.28s">para negocios de</span></span>
      <span class="line-mask"><span style="--d: 0.41s">Zona Norte.</span></span>
    </h1>

    <p class="fade-in mt-8 max-w-xl mx-auto text-base sm:text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed" style="--d: 0.7s">
      Soy Hernán, programador. Diseño, programo y publico tu sitio, y hablás siempre conmigo, no con una agencia ni con un vendedor.
    </p>

    <div class="fade-in mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center justify-center gap-3" style="--d: 0.85s">
      <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-solid">
        Pedir presupuesto
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#trabajos" class="btn btn-ghost">Ver trabajos</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Horizon arc + rotating badge -->
  <div class="relative mt-20 md:mt-28 h-28 md:h-40" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 w-full h-full" viewBox="0 0 1440 160" preserveAspectRatio="none" fill="none">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="arc" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="0">
          <stop offset="0" style="stop-color: var(--accent)" stop-opacity="0" />
          <stop offset="0.5" style="stop-color: var(--accent)" stop-opacity="0.7" />
          <stop offset="1" style="stop-color: var(--accent)" stop-opacity="0" />
        </linearGradient>
      </defs>
      <path d="M0 150 Q720 -40 1440 150" stroke="url(#arc)" stroke-width="1" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" />
    </svg>
  </div>
  <a href="#trabajos" class="fade-in absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bottom-6 md:bottom-12 w-24 h-24 md:w-28 md:h-28 grid place-items-center group" style="--d: 1.1s" aria-label="Ver trabajos">
    <svg class="spin-slow absolute inset-0 w-full h-full" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs><path id="circle" d="M50 50 m-38 0 a38 38 0 1 1 76 0 a38 38 0 1 1 -76 0" /></defs>
      <text fill="currentColor" class="text-muted" font-size="8.6" letter-spacing="2.4">
        <textPath href="#circle">{circleText}</textPath>
      </text>
    </svg>
    <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-line grid place-items-center bg-ink transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-[var(--accent-ink)]">
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M6 13l6 6 6-6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
    </span>
  </a>
</section>
